<title>USA: Virgina Resources Authority, won by Ferris Baker.</title>
<headline>Virgina Resources Authority, won by Ferris Baker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferris Baker Watts said it won $13.890 million of   Virginia Resources Authority, water and sewer system revenue</p>
<p>bonds, 1996 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.7264 percent.</p>
